  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temu kilenu munyi kwakwa ya muYerusalema niniku niniku, mutali, mwiluki, mukeŋi akeŋi imumaluba nzawu, mumoni neyi mukutwesha kuwana muntu himuntu wakoŋaŋa mwachiyulu, wakeŋa akeŋaŋa yaka shinshi; kulonda nimwanakeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela ahoshaŋa nawu, Chahandayi Yehova kwaamu; chalala asanyikaŋa chakutwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, mesu eyi hiyatala ŋaya kashinshuku? Wuna yeti, wena kutiya kukata nehi; wuna yinoŋeshi, wena kwonti kwawu kuyibabesha; anachinchikishi kumesu awu kubadika ilola; kwonti kwawu kufunta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinu kwila nami, Chalala awa hiya tuzweŋi, asupa, muŋa wena hiyeluka njila yaYehova, hela wuŋa jiwa Nzambi yawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tali niyi kudi antu alema, nihoshi nawu wena; muŋa wena diwu elukanjila yaYehova, niwu ŋaji waNzambi yawu. Hakwila awa kwawu anakotoli mpanda namuchima wawu wumu hohu, ninyonji anaketoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutupa wakufuma mwisapa wakayijaha, kapwidi kamelela kakayibuwapa, chisumpwakabela minaŋa kunyikala yawu, antu ejima akedikamu akayisansola; muŋa nyiŋa yina vuli, nimwanaselu mukiluwu hanyima munasweji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuku twesha kukwanakena pahi? Anya neyi analeki dehi, anasanyiki akadi kwikala Nzambi. Chinayiikutishili hiyakwila niwuvumbi, hiya kupu piki laku matala awa yivumbi awambanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habudidi adi neyi atuwalu akudi isha dehi; iwu hakutambika iŋoda mukwawu, iwu hakutambika iŋoda mukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nile kikuyi hempula na yumiyi, tahindi? Nileki kuditenda hamuza wudi chochichi, tahindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandamenu hampwembu jindi, mujilumu niantu; bayi dinu muyi manisha chikupuku. Fumishenu kunyita yi yindi, muŋa hiyaYehovaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulopa niakwamutaŋa waIsarela niakwamutaŋa waYuda anankwatili nankashi makasu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anamu twambishi Yehova nawu, Hekala chumaku. Nawu, Chuma chatama hicha katuwa naku, mpoku yakabali hela nzala hitwa kayi monaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawu, Atuprofwetu akabalumuka himpepela, izu hididi mudi wenaku. Dichi chakayi kopawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova Nzambi wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Ochu chimukuhosha izu idi, tiyenu, ami nukubalumuna mazu ami adi mukanwa keyi ekali kesi, antu awa ekali nchawa, kesi kakayinopesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela tiyenu, nakayiletela muza wakwakulehi, himuza waŋa Ŋovu, himuza wanyaka nanyaka, muza w edim i dimwabula kwiluka, ahosha mwákubulakutiyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyingo nguyawu yansewu yidi neyi ŋamu dachashi, wejima wawu hiya yilo buhohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadya yakudya yeyi yiwukukepa kwaŋula, ninshima yeyi yikukeŋa kudya anyaneyi amayala nawambanda. Akadya yimuna yeyi niyanyanya niyamaneni kumu. Akadya ninyi vinyu yeyi niyi kuyu yeyi. Nyika la yeyi yayipaka yiwakuhweleleli akayipupapupa nampoku yakabali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hela hamafuku owu hinakakumisha chikupu nsaŋu jenuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwakela munahoshi dehi nenu, Yehova Nzambi yetu natukoŋa elidi yuma yeji miyi? hiwakayila neyi, Chimunanleki ami, himukukalakela akishi awantu akwacheŋi mwituŋala denu, dichi chimwa kakalakela antu akwacheŋi mwituŋa mbala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chumichi chishimunenu mumutaŋa waYakoba, chitiyakeshenu muYuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenu, Enu antu asupa mwabula muchima, enu mwela mesu mukweti kumonaŋanehi; matu mukweti kutiyapanehi; tiyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, Yehova nindi, Himwanti yaloŋa womaku? Ami nashili wusekulula nami wikali ŋinza yaka lupalwŋi yalushimbi lwahaya nyaka kulonda kabuli kubadikahu, kutiya woma kumesu ami nehi? Hela mankanda adi nakubenkapila hiyanatweshi kumotoka hoku; hela avumapa anakaŋa anyi kubadikahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa antu awa akweti muchima wawinyi nikudi kaŋa; analeti dehi winyi, anayi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye laŋa munyi chima yawu nawu, Yehova Nzambi yetu watwinkaŋa nvula, niyakusambila niyakukuminina hachila aka chayu, watuhembelaŋa nyilu nguyakufu ukula dehi yakwaŋula kudya, tumu tiyenuwomaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuluwaluwa kwenu kwoku nayiteŋa ulwili yumiyi mwakayi fumaŋa akudenu, nshidi jenu jojinayi bondi yuma yayiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mukachi kawantu ami anawanumu antu atama; ayaloŋa anakutala nyonjiya taŋawu; hiyakuta muhetu, hiya kulawula antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matalawu anenzalina yuma yakudimbana neyi chiŋa ala chinenzali natujila, dichi chanabalu mukiluwu kwika la amaneni, hiyanekali dehi akwakuheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
